    "text": "Potent activity of ponatinib (AP24534) in models of FLT3-driven acute myeloid leukemia and other hematologic malignancies.",
    "unit_type": "TITLE"
  },
  {
    "bbox": null,
    "caption": null,
    "char_end": 1490,
    "char_start": 0,
    "column": null,
    "content_hash": "923f8198a9afdf7da4d65337beb5692c1c12c05b64e49fceac64dc6a477c7eb7",
